OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786578479
OL,3,CWoman describes 'panic' of being given
OL,4,Cwrong medication while pregnant
OL,6,FWords by ITV News Producer Michael
OL,7,FMaitland-Jones
OL,9,FDeborah Davison didn't think twice
OL,10,Fabout taking the medication given to
OL,11,Fher by the in-house pharmacy at her GP
OL,12,Fsurgery while she was pregnant.
OL,14,FShe was expecting to be given
OL,15,Fantibiotics for a UTI she was
OL,16,Fsuffering from.
OL,18,F"I was incredibly unwell, largely
OL,19,Fconfined to bed, and much more
OL,20,Fvulnerable than usual," she recalled.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
