CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786578479
OL,3,CWoman describes 'panic' of being given
OL,4,Cwrong medication while pregnant
OL,6,FHowever, after three days of taking
OL,7,Fthe tablets, she was called by the GP
OL,8,Fpractice asking her to come in
OL,9,Fimmediately and bring the medication
OL,10,Fwith her.
OL,12,FShe recalled the "panic" of whether
OL,13,Fwhat she'd been taking could affect
OL,14,Fher pregnancy, adding: "Initially, I
OL,15,Fwas just like, what have I been
OL,16,Ftaking, is it going to have side
OL,17,Feffects, is this dangerous?"
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786578479
OL,3,CWoman describes 'panic' of being given
OL,4,Cwrong medication while pregnant
OL,6,FMs Davison was particularly nervous
OL,7,Fbecause she had had a miscarriage at
OL,8,F16 weeks before getting pregnant
OL,9,Fagain, and was doing everything she
OL,10,Fcould to stay healthy.
OL,12,FShe was told that the medication given
OL,13,Fto her had, in fact, been
OL,14,Fantidepressants meant for someone with
OL,15,Fa similar name to her.
OL,17,F"Normally, if I'd been fit and well, I
OL,18,Fthink I would have noticed", she said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
