FL,318,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786578479
OL,3,CWoman describes 'panic' of being given
OL,4,Cwrong medication while pregnant
OL,6,FDeborah didn't suffer any lasting harm
OL,7,Ffrom the mix-up, with cases like hers
OL,8,Fdubbed "near misses" in the medical
OL,9,Fprofession.
OL,11,FBut while she received an apology at
OL,12,Fthe time, she said she continued to be
OL,13,Fconfused with other patients at the
OL,14,Fpractice.
OL,16,F"Surely this must be happening a lot
OL,17,Fif it can happen to me and nothing is
OL,18,Fchanged," she said.
OL,20,F'Lost in the system'
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
