OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786578479
OL,3,CWoman describes 'panic' of being given
OL,4,Cwrong medication while pregnant
OL,6,FData shows that cases like hers are
OL,7,Fnot uncommon. Research published by
OL,8,FHealthwatch and the King's Fund says
OL,9,Fthat two-thirds of patients and carers
OL,10,Fwho used NHS services in the 12 months
OL,11,Fto April experienced at least one
OL,12,Fadministrative problem.
OL,14,FThis can range from people receiving
OL,15,Fincorrect letters about appointments
OL,16,For struggling to get results from
OL,17,Fscans, to incidents like what happened
OL,18,Fto Ms Davison.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
