PN,31706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786578479
OL,3,CWoman describes 'panic' of being given
OL,4,Cwrong medication while pregnant
OL,6,FIn a statement, Healthwatch England
OL,7,Fsaid there are "countless" stories of
OL,8,Finformation being miscommunicated to
OL,9,Fpatients.
OL,11,FIt added that admin failures
OL,12,F"frustrate patients, leaving people
OL,13,Ffeeling forgotten during waits for
OL,14,Fcare and damaging confidence in
OL,15,Fservices".
OL,17,FHave you been affected by this issue?
OL,18,FIf so, you can contact us at
OL,19,Fyourstory@itv.com
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
