PN,31707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786578479
OL,3,CWoman describes 'panic' of being given
OL,4,Cwrong medication while pregnant
OL,6,FThe statement said: "Incorrect medical
OL,7,Frecords can have serious implications
OL,8,Ffor patient safety... poor admin
OL,9,Faffects the efficiency of the NHS, for
OL,10,Fexample when clinicians' time is
OL,11,Fwasted with patient no-shows caused by
OL,12,Fwrong or delayed appointment letters.
OL,14,F"Moving to a system that gets admin
OL,15,Fright and invests in admin staff
OL,16,Fdevelopment would have the potential
OL,17,Fto transform people's experience of
OL,18,Fcare."
