CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786578479
OL,3,CWoman describes 'panic' of being given
OL,4,Cwrong medication while pregnant
OL,6,FA spokesperson from the Department of
OL,7,FHealth and Social Care said that: "All
OL,8,Fpharmacists and pharmacy staff are
OL,9,Frequired to follow robust procedures
OL,10,Fto ensure medicines are correctly
OL,11,Fsupplied to each patient, as well as
OL,12,Fcarrying out appropriate checks before
OL,13,Fany medicine is dispensed."
